1
00:00:03,400 --> 00:00:07,100
Got a lot of cabinets to add? Bring them in from a spreadsheet instead of one by one.

2
00:00:07,100 --> 00:00:11,812
This is the sample templates file that comes with the app. Sizes in it are millimetres.

3
00:00:11,812 --> 00:00:18,499
Import CSV / XLSX: choose the file and say what it holds.

4
00:00:18,499 --> 00:00:24,947
A preview shows every row first. Matching names are updated, new ones added, nothing deleted.

5
00:00:24,947 --> 00:00:32,712
Import, and the four new templates are ready for any job.

6
00:00:32,712 --> 00:00:41,197
Export bundle saves the whole library in one file: materials, edgebands, hardware, templates.

7
00:00:41,197 --> 00:00:43,000
Use it as a backup, or to set up the same library on the shop computer.

8
00:00:43,000 --> 00:00:50,137
Import bundle merges a saved library back in, matched by code and name.
